# The rendered videos, captions, chapters, transcript checks and thumbnails (dev/video/): uploaded
# to YouTube and kept outside the repo. The .rendered-from records stay, so
# recompute_results.py --check can tell whether the uploaded videos match their sources.
/assets/video/*
!/assets/video/*.rendered-from
